Akbar, Akbar..(2)<br>
<br>
Allahu Akbar, Allahu Akbar, Allah, Allahu Akbar<br>
<br>
Subh e ashura hui, maa ne ro ro ke suni<br>
Ali Akbar ki azaa'n<br>
Akhri fajar hai yeh..(2)<br>
is moaazin ke liye, phir yeh awaaz kaha'n<br>
<br>
Subh e ashura hui, maa ne ro ro ke suni<br>
Ali Akbar ki azaa'n<br>
<br>
1. Dasht mein pyaase moazzan ne, jo takbeer kahi<br>
Aagayi apne musalle pe, Ali ki beti<br>
Yaad phir aayi use, Apne Baba ki azaa'n<br>
ro padi aun ki maa<br>
<br>
Subh e ashura hui, maa ne ro ro ke suni<br>
Ali Akbar ki azaa'n<br>
<br>
2. Abhi kuch der salamat hai, haram Ka parda<br>
Sham ke waqt jab ayegi, azaano ki sadaa<br>
Jaa'n bachane ke liye, sar chupane ke liye<br>
chadarein hongi kaha'n<br>
<br>
Subh e ashura hui, maa ne ro ro ke suni<br>
Ali Akbar ki azaa'n<br>
<br>
3. Roke bete ne kaha baap se, hasrat hai meri<br>
Aap ki behen to sun leingi, sadaa Akbar ki<br>
In hawaon se kahein, rukh madine Ka karein<br>
meri sughra hai waha'n<br>
<br>
Subh e ashura hui, maa ne ro ro ke suni<br>
Ali Akbar ki azaa'n<br>
<br>
Ash hadu anna mohammad ar rasoolallah<br>
<br>
4. Naam aaya jo Mohammad ka, to roye maula<br>
Inna lillah padha aur yeh ghazi se kaha<br>
Is ko maarenge sinaa, yeh musalmaan bhala<br>
rehem khayenge kaha'n <br>
<br>
Subh e ashura hui, maa ne ro ro ke suni<br>
Ali Akbar ki azaa'n<br>
<br>
Ash hadu anna ameer al mo'mineena wa imam al muttaqeena<br>
aliyun hujjatullah...<br>
<br>
5. Aaya jab naam e Ali uth ke yeh maula ne kaha<br>
Mai fida aap pe Baba meri aulaad fidaa<br>
Teer Asghar ke lage, seena Akbar ka chide<br>
mujh pe khanjar ho rawa'n<br>
<br>
Subh e ashura hui, maa ne ro ro ke suni<br>
Ali Akbar ki azaa'n<br>
<br>
6. Kitna tadpega Hussain ibn e Ali aye beta<br>
Teri maa, teri phuphi, teri sakina, sughra<br>
Jee nahi payeinge sabhi, tujh ko barchi Jo lagi<br>
tujh mein hum sabki hai jaa'n<br>
<br>
Subh e ashura hui, maa ne ro ro ke suni<br>
Ali Akbar ki azaa'n<br>
<br>
7. Masjid e kufa nazar aane lagi karbobala<br>
do azano pe bohot royi, hai bint e zehra<br>
Aaj tak bhooli nahi, ek baba ki azaa'n<br>
ek Akbar ki azaa'n<br>
<br>
Subh e ashura hui, maa ne ro ro ke suni<br>
Ali Akbar ki azaa'n<br>
<br>
8. Kis qadar dard mein doobi thi sadaa Akbar ki<br>
gash se uth kar kaha Sajjad ne batlayein phuphi<br>
Sub kyu rote hai yaha'n, shor hai kaisa bapaa<br>
kaun deta hai azaa'n<br>
<br>
Subh e ashura hui, maa ne ro ro ke suni<br>
Ali Akbar ki azaa'n<br>
<br>
9. Kaise manzar ho bhala mir takallum ho raqam<br>
baab e sa'at pe hui satra(17) azane jis dam<br>
Sun ke ek-ek azaa'n, ro ke kehti thi wo maa<br>
mere Akbar ho kaha'n<br>
<br>
Subh e ashura hui, maa ne ro ro ke suni<br>
Ali Akbar ki azaa'n<br>
<br>
Allahu Akbar..